    "description": "OpenAPI contract for j100-pack-rollout-from-tenant-onboarding-to-first-action. Exact articles: 45 CFR 164.308 administrative safeguards; 45 CFR 164.310 physical safeguards; 45 CFR 164.312 technical safeguards; 45 CFR 164.316 policies, procedures, and documentation requirements; 45 CFR 164.502 uses and disclosures of protected health information; 45 CFR 164.514 de-identification and limited data set requirements; 45 CFR 164.524 access of individuals to protected health information; 45 CFR 164.530 administrative requirements; ADR-0251 pack activation and cell certification levels; ADR-0243 Cedar default-deny and signed fragment bundle publication"
  },
